# packages.list — desktop profile (X11 only).
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 The wtfbsd contributors. BSD-2-Clause (see LICENSE).
#
# One package name per line; '#' starts a comment. The list is merged with
# overlay/base/packages.list by build.sh and installed by /install.site with
# pkg_add(1).
#
# The desktop is the base Xenocara plus the xfce package: there is no
# Wayland anywhere and no display manager package (no LightDM). The X
# server is started with xenodm(1) through startx, and the session of the
# operator's account is the Xfce session (see etc/skel/.xsession).

xfce
